==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Revolutionary Nobunaga]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Peons here are sparse. With just a few [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|anti-alien treasures]], the Hyppoh becomes a non-threat, while the other peons can be dispatched with units like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]], obviously with proper meatshielding. Butterfly Cat can also be used to take down the boss quickly when no other enemies are present.

==Trivia==
*Since it contains [[Revolutionary Nobunaga]], Despot's Ambition may be a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Nobunaga's Ambition|Nobunaga's Ambition]]'' series of games.
*The [[Angelic Gory]] supporting Revolutionary Nobunaga may be a reference to how the real [[wikipedia:Oda Nobunaga|Oda Nobunaga]] is sometimes referred to as the "Demon King of the Sixth Heaven".

